        {
          "text": "Nuko Mose aramvura ukuboko hejuru y’ikiyaga; Uhoraho ahuhutisha umuyaga mwinshi uvuye i burasirazuba, ukēsha ijoro ryose, usubiza ikiyaga inyuma, amazi ayagabanyamwo kubiri, ahindura ikiyaga ahūmūtse. ",
