            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyegiputa na bo babakurikira hagati mu kiyaga babōmye inyuma, n’amafarasi ya Farawo yose, n’imikogote yiwe, n’abagendera ku mafarasi biwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mu gicugu ca nyuma Uhoraho acishiriza ari mu nkingi y’umuriro n’igicu, arunguruka ingabo z’Abanyegiputa, azica ivutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuma amagurudumu y’ imikogote yabo afata, ntiyaba igikwegeka neza. Maz’ Abanyegiputa baravugana, bat’ Enda duhunge, tureke Abisirayeli, kuk’ Uhoraho abatabara, ari we aturwanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
