            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Mose aramvura ukuboko hejuru y’ikiyaga; umutwenzi utambitse, ikiyaga gisubira muri nyina; maz’ Abanyegiputa bagize ngo barahunga, Uhoraho abacurikiraniriza hagati mu kiyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw amazi asubirayo, arengera imikogote n’abagendera ku mafarasi, mbere n’ingabo za Farawo zose zāri zigiye mu kiyaga zikurikiye Abisirayeli; ntihārokoka n’umwe muri bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw Abisirayeli bāciye hagati mu kiyaga nk’abaca ku musozi, amazi ababera nk’umurombero i buryo n’i bumoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
