              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Abisirayeli babona ibihambaye Uhoraho yakoreye Abanyegiputa: baca batinya Uhoraho, baramwizera, bo n’umusavyi wiwe Mose.",
          "type": "text",
